      "message": "musig: allocate scratch space for multi-exponentiation in pubkey_agg\n\nIn secp256k1_musig_pubkey_agg, secp256k1_ecmult_multi_var was called with a\nNULL scratch space, falling back to secp256k1_ecmult_multi_simple_var where\neach public key scalar multiplication is evaluated individually with up to\n129 point doublings per signer.\n\nResolve the TODO in secp256k1_musig_pubkey_agg by allocating a temporary\nscratch space sized for Strauss (or Pippenger when n_pubkeys >\nECMULT_PIPPENGER_THRESHOLD). This enables multi-scalar multiplication to\nshare the doubling loop across all signers.\n\nIn local benchmarks on x86_64, this reduces pubkey aggregation cycles by\n34% for 4 signers, 57% for 16 signers, and 58% (saving over 10M cycles) for\n128 signers, while passing all MuSig2 test vectors and module tests.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Yudistira Putra",
